# Fortnite Chest Counter

A Fortnite chest counter and stats tracker written in C#. It runs as a console
app (v1.5.0) and shows your numbers in an in-game overlay, so you can follow
your progress without leaving the match.

## Features

- Total chests opened, plus chests from the last match and the current session
- Personal best (most chests in a single match)
- Full account stats: wins, losses, win rate, matches, K/D, kills, kills per
  match, play time, average match time, damage, assists and accuracy
- Account level display
- In-game overlay with three views (mini bar, chests panel, full stats cards)
- OBS cards for streamers, with your name and season shown on them
- Multiple languages (Portuguese included)

